      "writtenOn": "2017-11-07T18:21:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the ISIM app is locked, then IsimUiccRecords will never notify \"LOCKED\" or \"LOADED\", it seems an issue to me. Even we don\u0027t need to read the ICCID for ISIM in case of LOCKED, maybe we still need to notify \"LOCKED\" just like SIM and RUIM?",
